      "description": "Paired L-beams provide roller-supporting web tracks, longitudinal web edges, flange travel slots, and structural support. A bearing rotatably interconnects the chassis and threaded shaft at their longitudinal ends (claim 9). Fixed pedestals and travel-slot ends resist scissor-leg extension (claims 14–16).",
